---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout page="services" title="Our services | Connectivity Care Solutions" description="NDIS support coordination, daily living, independent living, community access, accommodation, in-home help, transport and respite in Eleebana, NSW.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Our services</h1>
      <p class="lede">Considerate, purposeful disability support that helps participants enjoy a more independent life. No one size fits all, so every service is tailored to the person.</p>
      <ul class="chips" aria-label="Jump to a service">
        <li><a href="#svc-support-coordination">Support Coordination</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-daily-living">Daily living</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-independent-living">Independent living</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-community-access">Community access</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-short-medium-stay">Short and medium stays</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-in-home">In-home services</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-shopping-domestic">Shopping and domestic</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-appointments">Appointments</a></li>
        <li><a href="#svc-respite">Respite</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap svc-list">
      <article class="svc svc-feature" id="svc-support-coordination">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/cafe.jpg" alt="A man smiling at an outdoor café table" style="object-position:50% 40%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>NDIS Support Coordination</h2>
          <p class="lede">NDIS Support Coordination is about helping you make the most of your NDIS plan and ensuring your supports work together to help you achieve your goals.</p>
          <p>A Support Coordinator works alongside you to understand what you want to achieve, connect you with suitable service providers, and help you navigate the NDIS system. We can assist with understanding your plan, coordinating your supports, building your confidence and independence, and resolving issues that may arise along the way.</p>
          <p>Our role is to support you to make informed choices and have greater control over your supports. We don't make decisions for you &mdash; instead, we provide guidance, information and practical assistance so you can make the choices that are right for you.</p>
          <p>We can also help coordinate communication between your providers, monitor whether your supports are meeting your needs, identify gaps in your services, and assist you to prepare for plan reviews or changes in circumstances.</p>
          <p class="svc-callout">Most importantly, Support Coordination is participant-focused. We take the time to understand your individual circumstances, preferences and goals and work with you at your own pace.</p>
          <p>Whether you're new to the NDIS or have been using your plan for some time, Support Coordination can provide the practical guidance and connection you need to use your plan effectively and work towards greater choice, confidence and independence.</p>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact?service=support-coordination">Ask about Support Coordination</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-daily-living">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/garden_bed.jpg" alt="Planting lettuce and seedlings in a covered garden bed" style="object-position:45% 55%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Assistance with daily living</h2>
          <p>Our team helps with everyday tasks at home and in your personal routine, so the day runs the way you want it to.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Personal care</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Meal preparation</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Household chores</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=daily-living">Ask about daily living support</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-independent-living">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/drill.jpg" alt="A woman with a cordless drill and tool belt, ready for jobs around the home" style="object-position:50% 38%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Supported independent living</h2>
          <p>Support for people with higher needs to live as independently as possible, in a safe and appropriate home environment.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Everyday support in the home</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Building independent living skills</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Help keeping routines on track</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=independent-living">Ask about independent living</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-community-access">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/swing1.jpg" alt="A young woman relaxing on a basket swing at a local park" style="transform:scale(1.9);transform-origin:46% 47%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Community access and group activities</h2>
          <p>Get out and about, try new things and meet other people in your community through outings, group activities and regular get-togethers.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Social outings</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Group activities and gatherings</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Exploring hobbies and interests</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=community-access">Ask about community access</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-short-medium-stay">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/sunset.jpg" alt="A walk along the beach at sunset" style="object-position:60% 62%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Short and medium stay accommodation</h2>
          <p>Temporary accommodation in a comfortable, supportive environment for when you need it.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Short-term stays</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Medium-term stays while longer-term housing is arranged</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Support available throughout your stay</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=short-medium-stay">Ask about accommodation</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-in-home">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/garden_smile.jpg" alt="Planting seedlings in a raised garden bed" style="transform:scale(1.6);transform-origin:84% 45%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>In-home services</h2>
          <p>Flexible, comprehensive support for you or your loved one in the comfort of your own home.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Support at times that suit your routine</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Personal and household help</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Company and a friendly face</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=in-home">Ask about in-home services</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-shopping-domestic">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/roses.jpg" alt="A woman smiling while holding a vase of yellow roses" style="object-position:55% 35%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Shopping and domestic duties</h2>
          <p>Let us take care of the shopping, errands and household chores so you have more time for the things you love.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Grocery shopping</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Running errands</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Cleaning and laundry</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=shopping-domestic">Ask about shopping and domestic help</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-appointments">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/bench.jpg" alt="A man in a cap and sunglasses sitting on a bench by the water" style="object-position:50% 40%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Assistance with getting to appointments</h2>
          <p>Reliable transport and support to get you to appointments, social catch-ups and activities.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Medical and therapy appointments</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Social events and catch-ups</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Activities and outings</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=appointments">Ask about transport support</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="svc" id="svc-respite">
        <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/swing2.jpg" alt="Swinging at a beachside playground on a sunny afternoon" style="transform:scale(1.35);transform-origin:42% 52%"></figure>
        <div>
          <h2>Respite</h2>
          <p>Everyone needs a break sometimes. Respite gives carers and participants time to rest and recharge, with a range of options to suit your situation.</p>
          <ul>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Short breaks for carers</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Time away for participants</li>
            <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-check"/></svg>Planned or flexible arrangements</li>
          </ul>
          <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/contact?service=respite">Ask about respite</a></div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta">
        <svg class="cta-heart icon-fill" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>
        <div>
          <h2>Not sure which service you need?</h2>
          <p>Tell us a little about your situation and we'll help you work out the right mix of supports.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-light" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+61488905457">Call +61 488 905 457</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
